---

## 5️⃣ Anti-Sybil Measures

- **Peer Scarcity:** 3 attestations per verified ID → prevents mass duplication  
- **Cryptographic Anchoring:**  
  ```text
  proof_hash = sha256(video_hash + voice_hash + peer_signatures + timestamp + nonce)

Optional Liveness Checks: Behavioral patterns prevent replay attacks

Graph-of-Trust: Peer attestations form a web-of-trust; suspicious activity flagged

6️⃣ Recovery & Fallback Options
Recovery Method	Description

| Recovery Method                           | Description                                                                                            |
| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Social Recovery (Guardians)**           | Assign 3–5 trusted peers. Minimum 3 approvals required to recover a lost key.                          |
| **Threshold Encryption**                  | Private keys split via Shamir Secret Sharing; no single guardian holds full key.                       |
| **Encrypted Community Cloud Backup**      | User-encrypted backups stored in community-governed nodes. Only owner + guardian approval can decrypt. |
| **Offline Hardware Backups**              | USB, SD, or hardware wallet storage. No cloud exposure.                                                |
| **Optional Guild / Event-Based Recovery** | Verified peers can assist key recovery after live verification events.                                 |

These methods preserve non-custodial sovereignty while making CivicIDs realistically recoverable.

